---
// The three products, side by side, each with its mark, its line, a small drawing
// and the way in.
import AgentsMark from '../brand/AgentsMark.astro';
import DmsMark from '../brand/DmsMark.astro';
import KeelMark from '../brand/KeelMark.astro';
import MiniAgents from './MiniAgents.astro';
import MiniDms from './MiniDms.astro';
import MiniKeel from './MiniKeel.astro';
---

<section class="band not-content">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2>Three products, built to work together.</h2>
      <p>
        Surogate Agents is where you build and run agents: each one has its own computer, browser and files, and works
        with your skills and knowledge. Keel runs your business processes, with agents, people and systems each doing
        their step. Surogate DMS keeps an institution's documents: filing, finding, signing, retention and handover to
        the archive.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card" data-docs="product-card">
        <div class="head"><AgentsMark size={48} /><h3>Surogate Agents</h3></div>
        <p>Run agents for your team, or build and train them.</p>
        <div class="drawing"><MiniAgents /></div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="/work/">Open the Agents docs</a>
          <a class="link" href="/work/quickstart/">Quickstart</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card" data-docs="product-card">
        <div class="head"><KeelMark size={48} /><h3>Keel</h3></div>
        <p>Design processes in Keel Builder, and work the cases in the business app.</p>
        <div class="drawing"><MiniKeel /></div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="/keel/">Open the Keel docs</a>
          <a class="link" href="/keel/quickstart/">Quickstart</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card" data-docs="product-card">
        <div class="head"><DmsMark size={48} /><h3>Surogate DMS</h3></div>
        <p>Keep your institution's documents, from the first upload to the archive.</p>
        <div class="drawing"><MiniDms /></div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="/dms/">Open the DMS docs</a>
          <a class="link" href="/dms/quickstart/">Quickstart</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    background: var(--d-bg);
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 88px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.76rem, 3.4vw, 2.47rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--d-ink);
  }
  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--d-text);
  }
  .cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .card {
    flex: 1 1 340px;
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--d-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--d-line);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--d-rule);
    padding: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--d-ink);
  }
  .card > p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--d-text);
  }
  .drawing {
    padding: 12px 0 4px;
  }
  .actions {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px 24px;
  }
  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    background: var(--d-mark);
    color: var(--d-markink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }
  .link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    color: var(--d-link);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }
  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--d-link);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
